=== 08 enter submits rather than chooses ===
 ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │ Command not found: /qu (alt+enter to send)             │
─┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴─
/qu
› /quit  leave the session, and say goodbye in a line long …





